      title="Transaction Screening Audit Trail Setup" id="11-audit-trail-test">

   <show-structure for="chapter,procedure" depth="2"/>
  
   <chapter title="Overview">
       <p><b>File:</b> <code>OtherTests/TransactionScreening/11.Audit_Trail_test.cy.ts</code></p>
        <p><b>Folder:</b> <code>OtherTests/TransactionScreening</code></p>
        <p><b>Description:</b> Ensures audit trail setups exist for Transaction Screening Case fields: AutoStatus and CaseStatus.</p>
        <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
        <p><b>Owner:</b> QA Team</p>
        <p><b>Tags:</b> regression, administration, audit-trail, configuration</p>
        <p><b>Dependencies:</b> cypress</p>
    </chapter>

    <chapter title="Test Suites">
        <chapter title="Transaction Screening Audit TRail Setup">
        </chapter>
    </chapter>

    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="should setup Audit logs for Auto Status Changes" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Configure Audit Trail for Auto Status</p>
            <p>Adds a field log setup entry for TransactionScreeningCase → AutoStatus under the Default context.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
            <step>1) Visit /administration/field-log-setups. 2) Click Add. 3) Select Context = Default. 4) Select Entity = TransactionScreeningCase. 5) Select Field = AutoStatus. 6) Save and accept either success or “already exists”.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• A setup exists for AutoStatus (either newly added or already present).</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
        <procedure title="should setup Audit logs for Case Status Changes" id="test-2">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Configure Audit Trail for Auto Status</p>
            <p>Adds a field log setup entry for TransactionScreeningCase → AutoStatus under the Default context.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
            <step>1) Visit /administration/field-log-setups. 2) Click Add. 3) Select Context = Default. 4) Select Entity = TransactionScreeningCase. 5) Select Field = AutoStatus. 6) Save and accept either success or “already exists”.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• A setup exists for AutoStatus (either newly added or already present).</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
    </chapter>

    <chapter title="Execution">
